{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Take over the city at extreme velocity!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop on your sci-fi motorcycle and complete various races, time trials and other challenges in a neon lit metropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390250/extras/32Secs_animgif_01.gif?t=1739889326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber-bikes with future tech</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack, boost and maneuver with different futuristic bikes on the endless highway. Tune up your vehicle with system updates and hardware upgrades - be the fastest racer in a world dominated by adrenaline seeking speedsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive like a cyber-maniac!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your racing skills and reflexes, dodge the police and knock out enemy motorbikes, while you zig-zag between futuristic traffic. Get higher speed and exact handling, use boosts and hacking tactically to leave your foes behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for the best trial time of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390250/extras/32Secs_animgif_02.gif?t=1739889326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go hard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the glowing, futuristic streets, find every boost, unlock every vehicle, beat every boss and collect as many coins as you can to upgrade your vehicle reaching extreme high speeds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 SECS will take you on a unique futuristic high-speed experience. Rush and take chances!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck rider!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Professional Speeder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390250/f966f5b83e4